# Mounted read-only at /cron/crontabs/root and read by busybox crond in the
# `cron` service. Times are UTC (the container has no TZ set); every endpoint is
# idempotent and interval-based, so UTC vs IST does not matter here.
#
# Cadences match .llm/deploy.md. Keep them in sync if you change either.
*/5  * * * * /cron/run.sh class-emails
*/15 * * * * /cron/run.sh reconcile-no-shows
*/15 * * * * /cron/run.sh lifecycle-bookings
0    * * * * /cron/run.sh reconcile-razorpay
20   1 * * * /cron/run.sh resume-passes
